  DisplayName: Student of Magic
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You are currently enrolled at a school of magic, where you're learning
    the fundamentals of your magical tradition. Whether your adventuring occurs during
    breaks between semesters, as part of a work study program, or even within the
    halls of the academy itself, you'll have to learn to juggle your dual life. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in your choice of Arcana, Nature, Occultism,
    or Religion, as well as Academia Lore. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Recognize
    Spell] skill feat.
